\code{analyze_dif_classical()} is retained as a compatibility wrapper. New code
should call \code{\link[=analyze_dif_mh]{analyze_dif_mh()}}, which names the method directly and avoids
implying that the helper is a fitted-MFRM \code{RSM}, \code{PCM}, or bounded-\code{GPCM}
